# oracle-inputs: w109tip_ch4hyd.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-7 abs=1e-10
# oracle: examples/PACKAGES/fep/CH4hyd/fep01 cut down: methane in TIP4P water (1085 atoms), pair_style hybrid of lj/cut/coul/long and lj/cut/tip4p/long/soft (lambda 1), pppm/tip4p 1e-4, shake, NVE 40 steps; the fix adapt and compute fep parts are left out
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (5 thermo rows, final atoms; v and f floor 1e-3): etotal 7.2e-10, pe 2.4e-9, evdwl 2.1e-12, ecoul 1.7e-12, elong 8.1e-12, temp 1.7e-10, press 4.5e-8; x 4.9e-10, v 3.6e-8, f 8.7e-7. Sources: src/pair_hybrid.cpp at b332f28, src/FEP/pair_lj_cut_tip4p_long_soft.cpp.
units           real
boundary        p p p
atom_style      full
bond_style      harmonic
angle_style     harmonic
special_bonds   lj/coul 0.0 0.0 0.5
read_data       w109tip_ch4hyd.data
pair_style      hybrid lj/cut/coul/long 10.0 10.0 lj/cut/tip4p/long/soft 3 4 2 2 0.125 1 0.5 10.0 10.0 10.0
pair_modify     tail no
kspace_style    pppm/tip4p 1.0e-4
pair_coeff      1 1 lj/cut/coul/long 0.0660 3.5000
pair_coeff      1 2 lj/cut/coul/long 0.0445 2.9580
pair_coeff      2 2 lj/cut/coul/long 0.0300 2.5000
pair_coeff      3 3 lj/cut/tip4p/long/soft 0.1628 3.1644 1.0
pair_coeff      3 4 lj/cut/tip4p/long/soft 0.0000 1.0000 1.0
pair_coeff      4 4 lj/cut/tip4p/long/soft 0.0000 1.0000 1.0
pair_coeff      1 3 lj/cut/tip4p/long/soft 0.1036 3.3279 0.0
pair_coeff      1 4 lj/cut/tip4p/long/soft 0.0000 1.0000 0.0
pair_coeff      2 3 lj/cut/tip4p/long/soft 0.0699 2.8126 0.0
pair_coeff      2 4 lj/cut/tip4p/long/soft 0.0000 1.0000 0.0
fix             SHAKE all shake 0.0001 20 0 b 2 a 2
neighbor        2.0 bin
timestep        1.0
velocity        all create 300.0 12345
set             type 1*2 charge 0.0
fix             NVE all nve
thermo_style    custom step etotal ke pe evdwl ecoul elong temp press
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          10
run             40
